      "structure_description": "The discrete Eu2Ti4 oxo core forms an elongated octahedron, with four Ti ions in the equatorial plane and two Eu ions at the apices. Two μ2-oxo and four μ3-oxo bridges connect the metal ions. Two (+)-pbpy and ten pivalate ligands protect the core; each Eu is eight-coordinate and each Ti six-coordinate."
